+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_RADIO_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radio[COLOR_REVERT] enables the powerful [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Bomber[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Flight[COLOR_REVERT]) and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Guided Missile[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Rocketry[COLOR_REVERT]) units, plus the Submarine units [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Attack Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Nuclear Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Rocketry[COLOR_REVERT]). It also allows you to build the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Eiffel Tower[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Cristo Redentor[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Rock N Roll[COLOR_REVERT] wonders. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] requires only Radio for [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Attack Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] and moves the [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Rocketry[COLOR_REVERT] requirement to the missile-carrying Submarine (now called [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Nuclear Submarine[COLOR_REVERT]).</English>
+		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radio[COLOR_REVERT] permet la construction de puissants [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Bombardiers[COLOR_REVERT] (avec l'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Aviation[COLOR_REVERT]), de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Missiles guid&#233;s[COLOR_REVERT] (avec les [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Fus&#233;es[COLOR_REVERT]), de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sous-marins d'attaque[COLOR_REVERT] (avec la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combustion[COLOR_REVERT]) et de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT]. Elle permet &#233;galement de construire la [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Tour Eiffel[COLOR_REVERT], le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Christ r&#233;dempteur[COLOR_REVERT] et de cr&#233;er le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Rock'n'roll[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Das [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Funkwesen[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht den m&#228;chtigen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Bomber[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Luftfahrt[COLOR_REVERT]) und die [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Lenkrakete[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Raketentechnik[COLOR_REVERT]) sowie das [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Angriffs-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT] und das [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Atom-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Raketentechnik[COLOR_REVERT]). Es erm&#246;glicht auch die Wunder [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Eiffelturm[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Cristo Redentor[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Rock 'n' Roll[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] erfordert lediglich Radio f�r [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Angriffs-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT], und [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Raketentechnik[COLOR_REVERT] ist stattdessen f�r das mit Raketen best�ckte U-Boot (neuer Name: [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Atom-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT]) erforderlich .</German>
+		<Italian>Le [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radiocomunicazioni[COLOR_REVERT] permettono la realizzazione di [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]bombardieri[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme al [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Volo[COLOR_REVERT]), dei [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]missili teleguidati[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme alla [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Missilistica[COLOR_REVERT]), dei [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sottomarini d'attacco[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme alla [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combustione[COLOR_REVERT]) e dei [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sottomarini[COLOR_REVERT]. Inoltre, permette la costruzione delle Meraviglie [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Torre Eiffel[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Cristo Redentore[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Rock N Roll[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radio[COLOR_REVERT] activa las poderosas unidades del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Bombardero[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con el [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Vuelo[COLOR_REVERT]) y el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Misil guiado[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Coheter&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT]), adem&#225;s de las unidades del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Cazasubmarinos[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combusti&#243;n[COLOR_REVERT]) y el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarino[COLOR_REVERT]. Tambi&#233;n permite crear las maravillas de la [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Torre Eiffel[COLOR_REVERT], el [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Cristo Redentor[COLOR_REVERT] y el [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Rock &amp; Roll[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.906: Overwrites the version in Civ4GameTextChanged_BTS.xml.
+		 No longer (explicitly) required for any Submarine. -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_COMBUSTION_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combustion[COLOR_REVERT] allows you to construct the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Transport[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destroyer[COLOR_REVERT] naval units. You may construct the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Public Transportation[COLOR_REVERT] building and the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Creative Constructions[COLOR_REVERT] Wonder.  It enables your workers to build the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Well[COLOR_REVERT] improvement on land-based [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Oil[COLOR_REVERT] resources and obsoletes the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Whale[COLOR_REVERT] resource.</English>
+		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]combustion[COLOR_REVERT] permet de construire des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]transports[COLOR_REVERT], des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]destroyers[COLOR_REVERT] et des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT] (avec la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]radio[COLOR_REVERT] et les [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]fus&#233;es[COLOR_REVERT]). Vous pouvez construire les [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]transports en commun[COLOR_REVERT] et la merveille  [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Constructions cr&#233;atives[COLOR_REVERT]. Elle permet &#224; vos ouvriers de construire des [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]puits[COLOR_REVERT] sur les cases contenant du [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]p&#233;trole[COLOR_REVERT] et entra&#238;ne l'obsolescence des [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]baleines[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Der [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Verbrennungsmotor[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht den Bau der Marineeinheiten [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Transportschiff[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Zerst&#246;rer[COLOR_REVERT]. Sie k&#246;nnen [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]&#214;ffentliche Verkehrsmittel[COLOR_REVERT] und das Wunder [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Creative Constructions[COLOR_REVERT] bauen. Ihre Bautrupps k&#246;nnen dann den [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Brunnen[COLOR_REVERT] &#252;ber der Ressource [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]&#214;l[COLOR_REVERT] an Land errichten. Die Ressource [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Wal[COLOR_REVERT] ist dann veraltet.</German>
+		<Italian>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combustione[COLOR_REVERT] permette di produrre il [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]trasporto[COLOR_REVERT], il [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]cacciatorpediniere[COLOR_REVERT] e il [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sottomarino d'attacco[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme alle [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radiocomunicazioni[COLOR_REVERT] e la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Missilistica[COLOR_REVERT]). Puoi inoltre costruire il [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Trasporto pubblico[COLOR_REVERT] e la Meraviglia [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Costruzioni Creative[COLOR_REVERT]. Inoltre permette ai lavoratori di costruire il miglioramento [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]pozzo[COLOR_REVERT] su caselle terrestri con [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]petrolio [COLOR_REVERT] e rende obsoleta la risorsa [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]balena[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Combusti&#243;n[COLOR_REVERT] permite construir las unidades navales del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Transporte[COLOR_REVERT], el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destructor[COLOR_REVERT] y el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Cazasubmarinos[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Radio[COLOR_REVERT] y la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Coheter&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT]). Puedes construir el edificio del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Transporte p&#250;blico[COLOR_REVERT] y la maravilla de [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Creative Constructions[COLOR_REVERT].  Adem&#225;s, permite a los trabajadores construir la mejora del [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Pozo[COLOR_REVERT] sobre las fuentes terrestres de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Petr&#243;leo[COLOR_REVERT] y deja obsoleto el recurso de las [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Ballenas[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.906: Originally in CIV4GameText_BTS.xml -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_STEALTH_DESTROYER_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>Disappear from enemy radar with the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Stealth Destroyer[COLOR_REVERT], a powerful late-game naval unit that is invisible to all units except other [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Stealth Destroyers[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] tries to make this unit more useful and realistic by giving it the same anti-air and anti-submarine abilities as [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destroyer[COLOR_REVERT] and a (limited) capacity for carrying missiles, while increasing the production cost and removing one of the first strikes. It's supposed to be expensive, but versatile. [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Robotics[COLOR_REVERT] is no longer required.</English>
+		<French>Disparaissez des radars ennemis gr&#226;ce au [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]destroyer furtif[COLOR_REVERT], unit&#233; navale invisible &#224; toutes les autres unit&#233;s &#224; l'exception des autres [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]destroyers furtifs[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Der [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Tarnzerst&#246;rer[COLOR_REVERT] kann vom feindlichen Radar nicht erfasst werden und stellt damit in der Sp&#228;tphase des Spiels eine m&#228;chtige Marineeinheit dar, die f&#252;r alle Einheiten au&#223;er anderen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Tarnzerst&#246;rern[COLOR_REVERT] unsichtbar bleibt. Um diese Einheit n�tzlicher und realistischer zu machen, erh�lt sie in [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] die gleichen Flugabwehr- und U-Boot-Jagd-F�higkeiten wie die regul�ren [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Zerst�rer[COLOR_REVERT]-Einheit, sowie (begrenzten) Raum f�r Raketen, w�hrend die Produktionskosten erh�ht werden - teuer, aber vielseitig. Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Robotertechnik[COLOR_REVERT] ist nicht mehr erforderlich.</German>
+		<Italian>Scompari dai radar nemici con il [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Cacciatorpediniere invisibile[COLOR_REVERT], un'unit&#224; navale avanzata invisibile a tutte le unit&#224; tranne che ad altri [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Cacciatorpedinieri invisibili[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Desaparece de los radares enemigos con el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destructor invisible[COLOR_REVERT], una poderosa unidad naval tard&#237;a que es indetectable por todas las unidades, excepto otros [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destructores invisibles[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.906: Originally in CIV4GameText_BTS.xml -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_ATTACK_SUBMARINE_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>The [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Attack Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] is the ultimate defense against [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarines[COLOR_REVERT]. While unable to carry missiles, it does receive a significant bonus against enemy [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarines[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] gives Attack Submarine the role of a generic submarine from the World Wars. Cost, strength, speed and requirements match those of the old Submarine unit (now called [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Nuclear Submarine[COLOR_REVERT]). Attack Submarine still can't carry missiles, but receives a high number of first strikes, which make it more effective against [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Battleship[COLOR_REVERT], but not against [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destroyer[COLOR_REVERT], which is now immune to first strikes.</English>
+		<French>Le [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marin d'attaque[COLOR_REVERT] est le moyen de d&#233;fense optimal contre les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT]. M&#234;me s'il ne peut transporter aucun missile, il b&#233;n&#233;ficie d'un bonus important contre les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT] ennemis.</French>
+		<German>Das [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Angriffs-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT] eignet sich hervorragend zur Verteidigung gegen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]U-Boote[COLOR_REVERT]. Es kann zwar keine Raketen transportieren, besitzt jedoch einen erheblichen Bonus gegen feindliche [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]U-Boote[COLOR_REVERT]. In [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] �bernimmt das Angriffs-U-Boot die Rolle eines Allzweck-U-Boots aus der Zeit der Weltkriege. Kosten, St�rke, Geschwindigkeit und Anforderungen entsprechen der alten U-Boot-Einheit (siehe unter dem neuen Namen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Atom-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT]). Angriffs-U-Boot kann weiterhin keine Raketen laden, erh�lt aber eine hohe Anzahl von Erstschl�gen, wodurch die Einheit gegen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Schlachtschiffe[COLOR_REVERT] effektiver wird, nicht aber gegen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Zerst�rer[COLOR_REVERT], denn letztere sind nun immun gegen Erstschl�ge.</German>
+		<Italian>Il [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sottomarino d'attacco[COLOR_REVERT] &#232; la difesa definitva contro i [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sottomarini[COLOR_REVERT]. Non pu&#242; trasportare missili, ma ha un bonus rilevante contro i [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sottomarini[COLOR_REVERT] nemici.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Cazasubmarinos[COLOR_REVERT] es la defensa definitiva contra los [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarinos[COLOR_REVERT]. Aunque no puede llevar misiles, recibe una importante bonificaci&#243;n contra los [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarinos[COLOR_REVERT] enemigos.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.906: Originally in Civ4GameText_Strategy.xml
+		 (not updated by BtS) -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_SUBMARINE_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Nuclear Submarines[COLOR_REVERT] are invisible to most units. They can explore rival territory and can carry special units, but are vulnerable to enemy [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destroyers[COLOR_REVERT] and other subs. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] renames this unit from just "Submarine" to "Nuclear Submarine". It carries missiles instead of special units (this was already the case in BtS) and takes the position of the BtS [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Attack Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] in the tech tree. Nuclear Submarine is now the more expensive of the two units.</English>
+		<French>Les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT] sont invisibles pour la plupart des autres unit&#233;s. Ils peuvent explorer le territoire ennemi et transporter des unit&#233;s sp&#233;ciales, mais craignent les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]destroyers[COLOR_REVERT] et sous-marins ennemis.</French>
+		<German>[COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]U-Boote[COLOR_REVERT] sind f&#252;r die meisten Einheiten unsichtbar. Sie k&#246;nnen feindliche Gebiete erforschen und Spezialeinheiten transportieren. Gefahr droht ihnen vor allem von [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Zerst&#246;rern[COLOR_REVERT] und anderen U-Booten. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] benennt das "U-Boot" um in "Atom-U-Boot". Das Atom-U-Boot transportiert Raketen anstatt Spezialeinheiten (das war bereits in BtS der Fall) und �bernimmt im Technologiebaum die Position der BtS-Einheit [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Angriffs-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT]. Von den beiden Einheiten ist nun Atom-U-Boot die teurere.</German>
+		<Italian>I [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sottomarini[COLOR_REVERT] sono invisibili alla maggior parte delle unit&#224;; possono esplorare il territorio rivale e trasportare unit&#224; speciali, ma sono vulnerabili agli attacchi dei [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]cacciatorpedinieri[COLOR_REVERT] nemici e ad altri sottomarini.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Los [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarinos[COLOR_REVERT] son invisibles para casi todas las unidades. Pueden explorar el territorio enemigo y transportar unidades especiales, pero son vulnerables a los [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destructores[COLOR_REVERT] y a otros submarinos.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.906: Originally in CIV4GameText_Strategy.xml. Said they have
+		 "a small chance" of interception, but it's not that small.
+		 Removed a sentence about stacking them with Transports and Carriers
+		 because stacking with Battleships also makes sense. -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_DESTROYER_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destroyers[COLOR_REVERT] can intercept enemy aircraft and are good at spotting and destroying enemy Submarines (which are invisible to most other units). To make the anti-Submarine role of Destroyer more pronounced, [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] gives first strikes to [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Attack Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Nuclear Submarine[COLOR_REVERT] and lets Destroyer ignore those first strikes.</English>
+		<French>Les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]destroyers[COLOR_REVERT] ont une petite chance d'intercepter les avions ennemis et sont &#233;galement tr&#232;s efficaces pour rep&#233;rer et d&#233;truire les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sous-marins[COLOR_REVERT] ennemis (invisibles pour la plupart des autres unit&#233;s). Ils sont souvent associ&#233;s &#224; des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]porte-avions[COLOR_REVERT] et &#224; des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]transports[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>[COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Zerst&#246;rer[COLOR_REVERT] k�nnen feindliche Flugzeuge abfangen und eignen sich gut f�r die Ortung und Versenkung feindlicher U-Boote (die f�r die meisten anderen Einheiten unsichtbar sind). Um die Rolle von Zerst�rern als U-Boot-J�ger besser zur Geltung zu bringen, verleiht [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Angriffs-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Atom-U-Boot[COLOR_REVERT] Erstschl�ge und l�sst Zerst�rer jene Erstschl�ge ignorieren.</German>
+		<Italian>I [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]cacciatorpedinieri[COLOR_REVERT] hanno una piccola probabilit&#224; di intercettare gli aerei nemici e sono particolarmente adatti per individuare e distruggere i [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]sottomarini[COLOR_REVERT] (che sono praticamente invisibili alla maggior parte delle unit&#224;). I cacciatorpedinieri vengono spesso utilizzati per scortare [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]portaerei[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]trasporti[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Los [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Destructores[COLOR_REVERT] tienen una peque&#241;a probabilidad de interceptar aeronaves enemigas y tambi&#233;n son muy &#250;tiles para detectar y destruir [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Submarinos[COLOR_REVERT] enemigos (que son invisibles para la mayor&#237;a de las unidades). Se suelen apilar con unidades de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Portaaviones[COLOR_REVERT] y [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Transportes[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+		 
 </Civ4GameText>

